.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: Grok Bot 0.56.1 (Windows)\u003cbr\u003e\nAccount: auth0|user_01M2Q0CT773XVA02CMD63N4KAJ\u003cbr\u003e\nTimezone: Asia/Shanghai\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494739-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494739-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494739-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494739-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCloud Agent Computer works (I can connect / take control / see the screen),\u003cbr\u003e\nbut I cannot send chat messages.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSymptoms:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDM: Failed to send\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGroup (X运营): \u003cspan class=\"mention\"\u003e@Grok\u003c/span\u003e Bot messages appear then disappear; no reply\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeekly usage only 12% (not quota)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://status.cursor.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003estatus.cursor.com\u003c/a\u003e: All Systems Operational\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTried:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuit/relaunch\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTake control and stop hung browser task\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eping in DM\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdate / Recover if available\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease do server-side Agent Computer recovery.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: Grok Bot 0.56.1 (Windows)\u003cbr\u003e\nAccount: auth0|user_01M2Q0CT773XVA02CMD63N4KAJ\u003cbr\u003e\nTimezone: Asia/Shanghai\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494739-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494739-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T08:47:08.489Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":22,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":111.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172121,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0-56-1-agent-computer-ok-chat-failed-to-send-messages-disappear","display_username":"生盛 李","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://status.cursor.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Cursor Status","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138589,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-0-56-1-agent-computer-ok-chat-failed-to-send-messages-disappear/172121/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":494749,"name":"Humanity","username":"humanity","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/h/94ad74/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T08:40:25.141Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003ei am having the same issues, were you able to figure this out? even when creating a new bot i have issues\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T08:40:25.141Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":172121,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0-56-1-agent-computer-ok-chat-failed-to-send-messages-disappear","display_username":"Humanity","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138594,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-0-56-1-agent-computer-ok-chat-failed-to-send-messages-disappear/172121/3","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":494821,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T09:40:00.483Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. Your Agent Computer is fine, so there’s no need to Update, Recover, or Reset. The issue isn’t with it or your setup.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat you’re seeing DM Failed to send, the \u003cspan class=\"mention\"\u003e@mention\u003c/span\u003e in the X运营 group appearing and disappearing while the Computer is still accessible is a known service-side issue that affects Grok Bot message processing. Your messages are still accepted and queued, they aren’t lost, and they should be processed once the bot is free. The message disappearing in the group is related to the same thing the group only waits for a bot reply for a limited time, and it stops waiting if the bot doesn’t respond in time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA couple notes for the future:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDon’t create extra bots or do a Reset, it won’t help, and new bots can end up in the same situation.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWe’re tracking this issue, but I can’t share an exact timeline yet.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf the bot stays silent for a long time, reply here with the bot name and the time of the last message, and we’ll take another look.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T09:40:00.483Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":172121,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0-56-1-agent-computer-ok-chat-failed-to-send-messages-disappear","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-0-56-1-agent-computer-ok-chat-failed-to-send-messages-disappear/172121/6","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":494823,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T09:40:35.991Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eA post was merged into an existing topic: \u003ca href=\"/t/some-of-the-bots-became-unresponsive-failed-to-send-on-my-messages-to